{"productId": "01418313-02db-4528-9166-d4ed32bf8b0e", "modelName": "VP9A1 K", "modelDescription": "With the new HK VP9A1, the best pistols (and the best shooters) get even better. The VP9\u2019s well-deserved reputation for being a handgun that actually helps people shoot better is backed by numerous reports from law enforcement of qualifying scores improving significantly after adopting it. All A1 upgrades to the VP9 revolve around enhancing the connection between serious users and their pistols. The improved trigger, the grip frame, the controls. They all work better with the user in the uncompromising pursuit of performance. In a first for the VP series, the VP9A1 series features a true compact \u201cK\u201d model. With a 4-inch barrel and a shorter frame, the \u201cK\u201d is a great concealed carry option between typical full-sized and subcompact pistols.", "manufacturerName": "Heckler & Koch", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "05e32f69-b5b0-47c9-851d-085a61e86589", "description": "Heckler & Koch, VP9A1 K, Semi Automatic, 9mm, 4.09\" Barrel, Black Finish, Night Sights, Holosun SCS, Ambidextrous, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5012e6ff-93dd-445e-8d2f-dd9c7ac1482e", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/0af38084-3e21-4744-9237-839b5ce24013"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "81001121", "upc": "642230268913", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2fa81b83-a1b1-4729-b87f-fbaba467061c", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "f24c6332-06ca-4e4f-8dcb-1cf9ec77de74", "valueName": "9mm"}, {"attributeNameId": "1dbab5b3-c07e-4fd5-93de-487557a9fe2d", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "8a1d50d5-ed69-4797-a816-6fe6930b5580", "valueName": "Electro Optics/Red Dots"}, {"attributeNameId": "cd129f75-5291-4a2c-b112-feeae8b358f8", "attributeName": "Action Type", "attributeValueId": "9dfcf319-f706-46a2-a2ec-f2486287f43c", "valueName